+      "fit": "For a lazy design the choke point is the right place. But the patch adds legacy ref-payload chasing to the typed resolver, leaves raw refs in persisted frames, and gates the behaviour on diagnostic data (debug.structured_repeat_until.exhausted, read by _loop_result_is_exhausted)."
