+      "generality": "Resolution is scoped and covers every generated ref kind, path fields in any variant, and nested fields.",
+      "fit": "Resolving at the producer with build_loop_scope, and declaring _resolve_ref_value on LoopRuntime, fits well. But reusing None (which means 'no policy') to report a resolution failure muddles the function's contract, and unrelated lowering and snapshot changes are bundled in."
